</ul>

<div class="insight-box">
<strong>Volume signal:</strong> Rising volume during the 2024–2025 drawdown is a double-edged signal. It shows active participation (not illiquid drift), which often precedes eventual price stabilization — but only once selling pressure exhausts. The Jun 2024 and Jun 2025 volume spikes (130M and 118M shares respectively) were likely tied to index rebalancing or fiscal year-end earnings.
